y a CALL, a fn-value `with_cursor`, `setmetatable` on an opaque arg), 3 io~. Repo-wide: pure 2,104 → 2,277, writes~ 2,644 → 1,691, the largest call cycle 53 → 18. 2026-10-07 (CART-1542): an AMBIGUOUS call whose refusal kept EVERY candidate (`refused.n == #refused.cands`) is the JOIN of the candidates' summaries instead of a hedge — a write any of them makes is one the call may make — under a PREMISE, that the target is one of them (a receiver the tree does not define, a vim handle's `:close()`, breaks it): `jp` on the summary, rendered `~` by purity, and `calls_commute` will not answer `commute` on it. The candidates are no call edges (ordering by them merged 1,674 functions into one component), so the passes repeat to the LEAST FIXPOINT (`effects.join_stats` = { rounds, computed = component computations over all passes, whole / cut = the joins in the LAST pass's recomputations — 0 / 0 on a converged run that reused everything }; 9 passes on cartograph). Which refusal rules join: `effects.JOIN` (`ambiguous` on; `blocked`, a cross-scope premise, off and not converging in 30 passes, CART-1545). And EVERY fold of one summary into another — a resolved callee, a callback, a substituted pair — carries the callee's TIERS (`over`, first hedge, `mh`, `nd`, `jp`) through one helper, and `call_effects` hedges on both premises (CART-1543: 211 functions had read determinate; CART-1558: the callback and substitution paths, 4 more). A builtin mutating a FIELD PATH (`table.insert(S.list, x)`, argv kind `field`, cache v223) writes what the direct store `S.list[i] = x` writes — the root var's first field, or the root param — and a field of a local stays hedged (`w.order = p` aliases without defining `w`) (CART-1560: 13,653 argument slots expr → field, 17 labels toward findings on cartograph). A function handed to pcall / xpcall / table.sort BY NAME is its signature or summary (CART-1563): a dotted module function (`pcall(M.helper)`) by its same-file name, a BUILTIN (`pcall(require, m